{"4183370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ravens Rest", "steam_appid": 4183370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into <strong>Raven’s Rest National Park, </strong>once a quiet landmark—now sealed off and overrun by the infected remains of a failed government experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rosanna Vale, a confident but reckless thief hired to steal a classified sample from a secret Department of Energy lab hidden beneath the park. What begins as an easy payday spirals into a fight for survival when the experiment’s true nature turns out to be more than she bargained for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the park’s haunted ruins, uncover the truth behind the E213 infection, and fight your way out before you become the next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Ravens Rest focuses on environmental storytelling, rather than jump-scare focused gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense survival gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Conserve ammo, manage light, and use the environment to avoid or outsmart the infected that roam the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles shape the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Restore power, reroute pressure valves, and activate long-dead systems to reach the hidden lab beneath the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosanna thought it would be simple: sneak into the park, grab a sample, get paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Raven’s Rest hides a secret. Years ago, a research team discovered a fungal organism deep in its caves—something capable of mimicking human consciousness. When the lab went silent, the government sealed the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the dead walk the park trails, and the entire park has become corrupted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section of the park—the visitors’ center, the flooded swamp, the mountain trails, and the underground bunker—unfolds another layer of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the time she reaches the lab, Rosanna will have to decide how far she’s willing to go to escape… and what she’ll leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Single-player survival horror experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* First-person exploration with puzzle and stealth elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Fully voice-acted dialogue and environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into <strong>Raven’s Rest National Park, </strong>once a quiet landmark—now sealed off and overrun by the infected remains of a failed government experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rosanna Vale, a confident but reckless thief hired to steal a classified sample from a secret Department of Energy lab hidden beneath the park. What begins as an easy payday spirals into a fight for survival when the experiment’s true nature turns out to be more than she bargained for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the park’s haunted ruins, uncover the truth behind the E213 infection, and fight your way out before you become the next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Ravens Rest focuses on environmental storytelling, rather than jump-scare focused gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense survival gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Conserve ammo, manage light, and use the environment to avoid or outsmart the infected that roam the park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles shape the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Restore power, reroute pressure valves, and activate long-dead systems to reach the hidden lab beneath the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosanna thought it would be simple: sneak into the park, grab a sample, get paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Raven’s Rest hides a secret. Years ago, a research team discovered a fungal organism deep in its caves—something capable of mimicking human consciousness. When the lab went silent, the government sealed the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the dead walk the park trails, and the entire park has become corrupted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section of the park—the visitors’ center, the flooded swamp, the mountain trails, and the underground bunker—unfolds another layer of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the time she reaches the lab, Rosanna will have to decide how far she’s willing to go to escape… and what she’ll leave behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Single-player survival horror experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* First-person exploration with puzzle and stealth elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Fully voice-acted dialogue and environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A horror adventure game following Rosanna, a thief tasked with breaking into Ravens Rest state park and retrieving and experiment. Things quickly take a turn however, as she discovers what the true nature of the experiment had in store.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183370/079c0178b14c82bbc960dbaf30ef0e86ecf1d1bc/header.jpg?t=1772205467", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183370/f7a650941a2df2192974f447bba63ab2667819e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772205467", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183370/f7a650941a2df2192974f447bba63ab2667819e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772205467", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 100 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 730<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Bryce Densmore"], "publishers": ["The Kongs Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [1465277], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Ravens Rest", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1465277, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Ravens Rest - $4.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 499}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "2", "description": "Strategy"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://share